The prices is a list of 1, 2, 3, 0, and 2.
The last is the last position of prices.
The holding is -1000000.
The sold is 0.
The resting is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The price is item spot of prices.
The oldholding is holding.
The oldsold is sold.
The oldresting is resting.
The buying is oldresting minus price.
If buying is more than oldholding, set holding to buying, otherwise set holding to oldholding.
Set sold to oldholding plus price.
If oldsold is more than oldresting, set resting to oldsold, otherwise set resting to oldresting.

If sold is more than resting, show sold, otherwise show resting.
